{
  "about": "#120: bare JSON tokens (numbers and literals) that the phone (JsonPreScan) and scripts/validate.py must both accept or both reject. RFC 8259 number: -?(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(\\.[0-9]+)?([eE][+-]?[0-9]+)? ; literals: true, false, null. Each token replaces both @ in template (an x- array element on line 4 and an x- value on line 5). Read by JsonNumbersConformanceTest and scripts/test_validate.py.",
  "template": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"pages\": [{\"id\": \"home\", \"items\": []}],\n  \"x-a\": [1, @, 2],\n  \"x-v\": @\n}\n",
  "accept": [
    "0",
    "-0",
    "1",
    "-1",
    "10",
    "123",
    "0.5",
    "-0.5",
    "1.0",
    "0.0",
    "-0.0",
    "1e5",
    "1E5",
